@startuml seq-raise-info

title raise info — Output Tool Metadata

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #444

actor "User" as user
participant "cmd/" as cmd

== Static metadata ==

user -> cmd : raise info [-o table|json|yaml] [--hery]
cmd -> cmd : build RaiseInfo{name, version,\nsupports: [amadla.org/entity/infrastructure@^v1.0.0],\ndescription}
cmd -> cmd : format per -o flag;\n--hery wraps in _type + _body envelope
cmd --> user : table / JSON / YAML on stdout, exit 0

== Notes ==

user -> cmd : (no plugin aggregation)
cmd --> user : supports list is static — plugin entity\ntypes are NOT aggregated despite a\nplugin.Service being constructed

@enduml
